'''Heliolisk''' (Japanese: '''エレザード''' ''Elezard'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

