==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Heliolisk|47}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}. 
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Heliolisk|50}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*{{m|Thunderbolt}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Heliolisk}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

